.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt PCI_MSI 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pci_enable_msi ,
.Nm pci_disable_msi
.Nd program MSI delivery for a PCI function
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In kern/pci.h
.Ft int
.Fn pci_enable_msi "pci_device_t *dev"
.Ft int
.Fn pci_disable_msi "pci_device_t *dev"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
These functions locate the MSI capability and program the device-side MSI
control fields.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
0 is returned on success.
Otherwise a negative error code is returned.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pci_find_capability 9
